{
  "text": " I mean, there's so few of us who get a public chance to speak out. But when you look at these mandates, they're based. They're using science to convince people of these mandates and the need for these mandates. The science isn't there. It hasn't been there for a long time. We know the data. I mean, they've corrupted science. I mean, I'm a physician. And when I look at the practice of medicine, all across this country, we're infusing drugs that are extremely expensive and don't work, some of which are toxic. The dangers of these vaccines and lack of efficacy vaccines, you can see it around the world, but not in the US. They're now on record the New York Times. They've hit it. They have not shared data with us. We've seen the data. When you look at US data, and you look around the world, where they're more transparent, they don't match up. This is all about supporting the global vaccination policy. They've sold tons of vaccines and lots of medicines that don't work. There's endemic corruption in this whole response. When we talk about the failure, look how the US has fared in the response to COVID. It's been a horrific failure. But a lot of people have made a lot of money. And I'm sorry to be a physician in society talking about corruption and money. But I've had to because I had a front-row seat. I've been subjected to this. I've seen people die every single day. They land on ventilators because of ineffective and under treatment. They have early treatments been suppressed. You know how many people have died? How many families have been ruined? And then I have people coming to me because their families in the hospitals and the doctors are doing really dumb stuff because they're using ineffective medicines and the people can see it. They keep dying. And they say, doctors, is there anything else you can do? I can't. Got to follow the protocol, which comes out of some building in Washington, DC. They're not letting doctors doctor. And I can see that. I've had to leave medicine. I've had to leave the ICU because I am not going to stand there and watch people die when I can't practice medicine. I can't give them things to save their lives. I mean, this has been just, this is too much. And I'm talking about the science and medicine. My friends, my partners here in the convoy, we talk about the lives, that question. That question, we remove mask mandates. And you're happy about that? Like everything's free now? I got my wife who's a doctor. She's going to lose her job if she doesn't get a booster. They're still boosting. They're still vaccinating for a disease that's mild with a two-year-old vaccine that has nothing to do with Omicron. This is insanity. We have completely lost our minds. I treated a patient yesterday. She's a pharmacist working in a hospital. She told me that the hospitalists are vaccinating COVID patients as they're being discharged. We've lost our minds. And the reason why we have done that is because nothing but unending propaganda and censorship. I don't know which of you guys are censoring the real truth and the real data. But it's happening. And when you do that to an extent, strange stuff happening. And I've had to sit there and I've had to watch the entire field of medicine doing really strange stuff causing a lot of death.",
